'''Weavile ex''' (Japanese: '''マニューラex''' ''Manyula ex'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

